<title>USA: Intermet Corp Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Intermet Corp Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			 $ 0.27		   $ 0.14</p>
<p> Net			  6,786		    3,377</p>
<p> Revs		     130,279		  117,331</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  25,427		   24,948</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Periods ended September 30 vs October 1  </p>
<p>		  9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.04		    $0.78</p>
<p> Net			 26,410		   19,434</p>
<p> Revs		     408,219		  419,644</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  25,472		   24,810</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The reduction in sales was caused primarily from the divestiture of two businesses in late 1995 which contributed $30 million in sales during the same nine-month period in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
